{"availability":"available","full":"winsznx/unflinch","name":"unflinch","description":"Exposure practice that moves at the speed of your nervous system. Live feared scenes on Visko Orbis, steered by breath, SUDS and choice every two chunks.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T16:20:04Z","updated":"2026-10-02T00:43:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://unflinch-zeta.vercel.app","topics":["exposure-therapy","hackathon","nextjs","orbis","supabase","visko","world-model"],"demo":"https://unflinch-zeta.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T00:44:57.423Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T00:44:57.423Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T00:44:57.423Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T21:45:51.299Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2105730115267395604","postId":"2105730115267395604","postedAt":"2026-10-01T18:42:36.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T20:03:44.529Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T21:45:51.299Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T00:44:57.423Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Name a fear and the outcome you dread. Unflinch generates it as one live scene on Visko Orbis. A deterministic controller reads your breathing, your distress rating and your own choices on every Orbis chunk (1.83 s at the documented 18 fps) and sends at most one scene change every two chunks: step closer, hold, or back off.","These come from 30 live Orbis sessions on 2026-10-01 (4 builder runs in evidence/live/, 26 campaign runs in evidence/campaign/), all with simulated input and labelled that way. The failed claim stays failed: the threshold was fixed before the run. Six claims still need a blind rater or a real phone. Every claim has a threshold, an artifact and an n in docs/CLAIMLEDGER.md.","Where things stand, including what failed: docs/STATUS.md."],"